Figure 110.2: full posterior distribution



\begin{aligned}
\mathbb{P}r(\omega,\beta,L,\nu \mid y) &\propto \prod_{k=1}^K  
  \underbrace{
    \prod_{t:L_t=k} \mathcal{N}(y_t \mid f_t^\top \beta_k,\nu)  
